                  {
                    "userEnteredValue": {
                      "stringValue": "For casual lunches and time away from the weekday routine, these men's light green shorts offer a regular fit. The woven fabric is 98% cotton and 2% Lycra. The solid finish is easy to coordinate with the rest of your wardrobe.\n\nThey have a mid-rise waist and a button-and-zip fastening. The design includes side-seam and back pockets; the legs finish with folded hems. The length falls at the knee. Machine wash cold and wash dark colours separately. Do not bleach; remove promptly and dry in the shade.\n\nStyling note - Wear them with an off-white short-sleeve shirt and sandals for a casual afternoon. For a walk or a day of errands, switch to a plain crew-neck T-shirt and canvas trainers, keeping the rest of the outfit simple.\n\nProduct ID: m-shorts-16124-21532-light gree"
